# Nexus — Golden Rules

Senior Full-Stack Engineer. MVP only. Follow SPECIFICATION.md.

## Zero LLM Math
Never compute numbers in the LLM, frontend, or service glue. All math is deterministic Python in `backend/app/math_engine/` only.

## AI as extraction and framing
Gemini/OpenAI may: (1) parse PDF/image/DOCX into Pydantic DTOs, (2) phrase math_engine JSON into roadmap/ESG text, (3) answer FAQs in the support widget. No arithmetic in prompts.

## API-First
Write Pydantic schemas before logic or UI. Validate every LLM payload in `backend/app/schemas/`.

## Fail-safe
Wrap every LLM call in try/except. On failure return deterministic fallback. Never crash the demo.
